						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 1
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Grant Water Breathing (11): A nixie may grant the ability to breathe water to any air-breathing creature. To do so, it must touch the subject, spend 1 FP, and make a Will roll. An unwilling target may resist in a Quick Contest of HT vs. the nixie’s Will, but a willing subject may waive its resistance roll. If the nixie makes its Will roll, the subject becomes able to breathe water for 30 minutes."
